  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers the OWASP Application Security Verification Standard (ASVS) 5.0.0: the three priority-based levels and how 5.0 redefined them, the 17 chapters V1 to V17 with their sections and key requirements, versioned requirement identifiers such as v5.0.0-1.2.5, documented security decisions, and using ASVS for requirements, verification reports and procurement. Version lines: 5.0.0 (released 2025-05-30) is current, 4.0.3 (2021-10-28) is legacy with an upgrade path through the official 4.0.3 to 5.0.0 mapping files, and the bleeding-edge master branch is tracked as a preview. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out the version lines, levels and usage, chapters V1 to V8, chapters V9 to V17, and the upgrade from 4.0.3.",
